Usage: {{project-name}} text [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  Text transformations over the textkit core.

Options:
  --format FORMAT  Output format for data commands: plain or json.
  --json           Shorthand for --format json.
  --no-color       Disable colour in diagnostics (NO_COLOR is also honoured).
  --verbose        Print diagnostics about what the command is doing.
  --quiet          Suppress diagnostics.
  --no-input       Never prompt; fail instead of asking.
  --dry-run        Show what would happen without writing anything.
  --help           Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  slugify   Convert text to a lowercase hyphenated slug.
  truncate  Shorten text to at most --max characters.
